      <h1 id="security-compliance-overview" class="group scroll-mt-20">OpenShift Container Platform security and compliance<a href="#security-compliance-overview" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h1>
      <p>Review the security and compliance capabilities available in OpenShift Container Platform, and learn how to secure your cluster.</p>
